  (text "External wake button J504 (B2B-XH-A 2P) to +3V3 via R510 1k with R501 10k pull-down to GND keeps the DevKit firmware logic (digitalRead HIGH = pressed);\n1 BTN_PULL (+3V3 via R510 1k), 2 BTN_USER (GPIO5). GPIO5 is an RTC GPIO: ext1 wake-up from deep sleep works (SW501 replaced by J504 per rework 2026-10-18).\nLEDs: D501 (FYLS-0603GD, ~1.2 mA from GPIO40 via R502 1k), D502 (KT-0603R, ~1.4 mA from GPIO41 via R503 1k). No power-up glitch.\nI2C bus GPIO8 SDA / GPIO9 SCL: on-board 4.7k pull-ups R504/R505 kept for U301 ADS1115 (0x48); J501 and J502 removed per rework 2026-10-18."
    (at 25.4 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "643c8610-31c5-4850-b791-f96ce81316a0")
  )
  (text "Voltmeter output (owner Q5; simplified W23 2026-10-15; sense resistor 2026-10-15): 0.28 in LED voltmeter 0-100 V. Single P-MOS high-side switch Q501 Si2309CDS, source on VIN_PROT (after D101:\nreversed clips never reach the module). GAUGE_EN (GPIO38) high -> R509/R508 divider -> Q503 sinks 70-105 uA (R507 10k) -> R506 100k sets VGS 7-10.5 V (limited to VIN_PROT;\n>= 4 V at a 5.25 V battery). Off: R508 holds Q503 off at reset. J503: 1 V_GAUGE (module supply via F501 0466.250 + R511 4.7 ohm anti-surge), 2 GND, 3 GAUGE_SENSE.\nSENSE through 10 k from VBAT_FUSED; 2-wire modules use pins 1-2. R512 10k: 3-wire modules read the battery after F101 (no D101 drop); a short on the sense lead is limited to 3.1 mA (96 mW at 31 V).\nThe ADS1115 reading is the reference. Fault coordination (review R2-01): a short on pin 1 is limited by R511 + F501 + Q501; F501 opens in <= 0.2 s (>= 300 %) or 0.04-0.3 ms (adiabatic).\nR511 fault energy at 5.25 V is <= 12.2 J (2.45 W for <= 5 s), below its 13.2 J overload test point (fixing doc-audit items D2, D25).\nFIRMWARE: never assert GAUGE_EN above 30.0 V (read the ADS1115 first; module limit 30 V).\nJ504 external button is fed through R510 1k: pressed level 3.0 V, and the GPIO5 power-up low glitch cannot short +3V3."
    (at 25.4 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "3a8543bc-99df-40ac-b8f2-8296c5358593")
  )
